      "notes": "REQ-002 要求对指定环境执行网络、认证、写权限三项检测并返回详细信息，本设计完全覆盖。"
    }
  ],
  "data_models": [
    {
      "id": "DM-001",
      "name": "EnvironmentConnectInfo",
      "type": "reference",
      "status": "active",
      "version": 1,
      "ownership": "derived",
      "source": {
        "doc_id": "lld-Primary Database-001",
        "model_name": "environments"
      },
      "description": "从环境管理数据库表投影的连接信息视图，仅包含连通性测试所需的字段",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "Integer",
          "required": true,
          "description": "环境唯一标识，主键"
        },
        {
          "name": "name",
          "type": "String",
          "required": true,
          "description": "环境名称，仅用于日志记录"
        },
        {
          "name": "host",
          "type": "String",
          "required": true,
          "description": "目标主机IP或域名"
        },
        {
          "name": "port",
          "type": "Integer",
          "required": true,
          "description": "SSH端口，默认为22"
        },
        {
          "name": "username",
          "type": "String",
          "required": true,
          "description": "SSH登录用户名"
        },
        {
          "name": "encrypted_private_key",
          "type": "String",
          "required": true,
          "description": "经AES-256-GCM加密的私钥密文"
        },
        {
          "name": "remote_path",
          "type": "String",
          "required": true,
          "description": "待检测写权限的远程目录路径"
        }
      ],
      "indexes": [],
      "source_requirements": [
        "REQ-002"
      ],
      "source_components": [
        "CMP-002"
      ],
      "source_contracts": [
        "CTR-005"
      ],
      "constraints": [
        "所有字段在数据库中应为NOT NULL约束",
        "port取值范围1-65535",
        "encrypted_private_key为经过AES-256-GCM加密的Base64编码字符串"
      ],
      "lifecycle": {
        "create": "",
        "update": "",
        "delete": "",
        "retention": "跟随environments表"
      },
      "change_history": [
        {
          "version": 1,
          "change_type": "created",
          "summary": "初始创建",
          "reason": "首次生成连通性测试服务LLD，定义derived数据视图"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "interfaces": [
    {
      "id": "IF-001",
      "name": "环境连通性测试",
      "status": "active",
      "version": 1,
      "source_contract_id": "CTR-005",
      "provider_component_id": "CMP-002",
      "method": "POST",
      "endpoint": "/api/environments/{id}/test-connectivity",
      "description": "对指定环境执行TCP连接、SSH认证、远程路径写权限三项检测，返回结构化测试结果。",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "integer",
          "in": "path",
          "required": true,
          "description": "目标环境ID"
        }
      ],
      "request_body": {},
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "tcp_status": "boolean",
          "ssh_auth_status": "boolean",
          "write_permission": "boolean",
          "details": "string (human-readable)"
        }
      },
      "error_codes": [
        {
          "status": 400,
          "code": "BAD_PARAM",
          "message": "路径参数格式错误（如非数字）"
        },
        {
          "status": 404,
          "code": "NOT_FOUND",
          "message": "指定的环境ID在数据库中不存在"
        },
        {
          "status": 422,
          "code": "UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY",
          "message": "环境记录中的关键字段为空或无效"
        },
        {
          "status": 500,
          "code": "DECRYPTION_FAILED",
          "message": "私钥解密失败（可能是密钥版本不匹配或数据损坏）"
        },
        {
          "status": 500,
          "code": "INTERNAL_ERROR",
          "message": "未预期的系统级内部错误"
        }
      ],
      "auth": {
        "required": true,
        "policy": "Bearer token (JWT)"
      },
      "validation_rules": [
        "id必须为正整数"
      ],
      "idempotency": "not_applicable",
      "pagination": "single_item",
      "source_requirements": [
        "REQ-002"
      ],
      "source_components": [
        "CMP-002"
      ],
      "source_contracts": [
        "CTR-005"
      ]
    }
  ],
